Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:38.66,Title,0,0,0,0,,《雷神3：诸神黄昏》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:22.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（荫萌疗养院）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:19.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布里克街177A）
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.70,2:10:24.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,雷神将在《复仇者联盟3：无限战争》中回归
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know what you're thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:01:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 托尔被关在笼子里了 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, no! Thor's in a cage. How did this happen?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时 你得先被抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sometimes you have to get captured{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能从某人那里问出个所以然来\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to get a straight answer out of somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实 我算是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}But basically, I'm a bit of a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去地球待了一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I spent some time on Earth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,打过几个机器人 救了地球几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}fought some robots, saved the planet a couple of times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我去宇宙中寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I went searching through the cosmos{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,几颗有魔法的多彩的无限宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}for some magic, colorful Infinity Stone things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't find any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时我遇到了一条死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I came across a path of death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,和毁灭之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and destruction…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而因此来到了这个笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}which led me all the way here into this cage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还遇见了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I met you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们还要在这里待多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer do you think we'll be here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔 奥丁之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, son of Odin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏尔特尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surtur, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.34,0:02:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八\N{\fnArial\fs30}son of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,之子 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}a bitch. You're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我父亲杀掉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought my father killed you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在50万年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}a half a million years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没有实现命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until I fulfill my destiny…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭你的家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lay waste to your home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好你提起这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny you should mention that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.89,0:02:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我最近一直在做噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I've been having these terrible dreams of late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德陷入烈火 成为一片灰烬 而你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard up in flames, falling to ruins. And you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.45,0:02:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏尔特尔 处于那一切之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surtur, are at the center of all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你已经见识到了诸神黄昏 阿斯加德的陨落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you have seen Ragnarok, the fall of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伟大的预言 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The great prophecy… - Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能转回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}back around shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.45,0:02:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真觉得我们刚刚聊得很投机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really feel like we were connecting there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 诸神黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我讲讲 仔细说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about that. Walk me through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的时代到来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My time has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我的王冠再次沐浴永恒烈火\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my crown is reunited with the Eternal Flame…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就将恢复全部力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be restored to my full might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,比山还高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tower over the mountains…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:03:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把剑深深插入阿斯加德的 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and bury my sword deep in Asgard's… - Oh, hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我根本没动 是它自己在转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I'm not even moving. It's just doing this on its own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 是这么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so let me get this straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.02,0:03:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把你的王冠放进永恒烈火里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to put your crown into the Eternal Flame…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.03,0:03:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你会突然变得有房子那么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you'll suddenly grow as big as a house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是山\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mountain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,永恒烈火 是奥丁锁在阿斯加德的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eternal Flame that Odin keeps locked away on Asgard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁不在阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin is not on Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的离开让王权失去了防卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your absence has left the throne defenseless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那王冠在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so where is it? This crown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.81,0:03:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的王冠 我力量的源泉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my crown, the source of my power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是王冠啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's a crown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是眉毛长得比较夸张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was a big eyebrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是王冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a crown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 听上去 我想阻止诸神黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, it sounds like all I have to do to stop Ragnarok…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要扯下你脑袋上那玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}is rip that thing off your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但诸神黄昏已经开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Ragnarok has already begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿斯加德的末日 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Asgard's doom, and so are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都将遭受煎熬 被烈火吞噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}All will suffer, all will burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's intense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 看着你变得老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, seeing you grow really big…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后烧掉一颗星球 肯定很壮观\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set fire to a planet would be quite the spectacle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但看来我只能选择第二条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it looks like I'm gonna have to choose option B…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我挣脱这铁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I bust out of these chains…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的头饰从脑袋上砸下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}knock that tiara off your head, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后藏在阿斯加德的地堡里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stash it away in Asgard's vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法阻止诸神黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot stop Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必抵抗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why fight it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 英雄都会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's what heroes do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 抱歉 我时机掐得不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I'm sorry. I didn't time that right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你犯了个大错误 奥丁森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have made a grave mistake, Odinson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常犯大错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make grave mistakes all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来结果还不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything seems to work out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔 我知道我们好久没联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall, I know it's been a while, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的很需要赶紧离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I could really use a fast exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔就是个蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall was an idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份工作本该让他发财的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This job should have made him rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份工作并不轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the job ain't easy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是有些好处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it does have its benefits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,彩虹桥让我可以接触到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bifrost gives me access to everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Nine Realms has to offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想拿就拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it's all mine for the taking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}my stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特别喜欢这俩玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm particularly fond of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从米德加德 一个叫德克萨斯的地方拿到了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled them out of a place on Midgard called Texas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还给它们起了名字 毁天和灭地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even named them. Des and Troy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 当它们合在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, when you put them together…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:06:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能毁天灭地\N{\fnArial\fs30}they destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔 我要没招了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall? I'm running short on options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.93,0:07:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科尔奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skurge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个要紧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that important?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩姑娘今天有好戏看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You girls are in for a treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呦呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看是谁决定回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who decided to pop in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你吓跑了我的女伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for scaring away my company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还弄得我的办公场所全是脑浆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and drenching my workplace in brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科尔奇 我们曾在华纳海姆并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Skurge. We fought together on Vanaheim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Heimdall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叛徒 没人知道 他是王室逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That traitor. No one knows. He's a fugitive of the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 奥丁指控海姆达尔玩忽职守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, you see, Odin charged Heimdall with negligence of duty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他在审判前就消失不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he disappeared before the trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想抓住一个能洞察宇宙中一切的人不容易 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hard to catch a guy who can see everything in the universe. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我要宣告你的到来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Hold on. I'm supposed to announce your arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥 时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, brother. This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take my leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真傻 怎么不听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fool, you didn't listen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,希芙女士 去找人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Sif, get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来帮帮忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为我做的一切道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for all I've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. It's all right. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我企图统治地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. I tried to rule Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你只会是他们的幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd be lucky to have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方的事我也很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about that thing with the Tesseract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是忍不住 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just couldn't help myself. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢耍诡计 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a trickster. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,总爱搞恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So mischievous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我那次把你变成了只青蛙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that time I turned you into a frog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很有趣的笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a wonderful joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是非常好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Twas indeed hilarious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是阿斯加德的拯救者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the savior of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 讲述我的故事 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell my story. - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.93,0:10:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我建一座雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Build a statue for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会为你建一座大雕像的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will build a big statue for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要戴着我的头盔 有大弯角的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my helmet on, with the big bendy horns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的英勇 我会禀告父王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell Father what you did here today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do it for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do it for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基因伤不治而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, Loki died of his wounds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为我们献出了生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}giving his life for ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他击退了那些可憎的精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fought back those disgusting elves…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为王国带来了和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}he brought peace to the realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基 我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}my boy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年前 我发现了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'twas many moons ago I found you on that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.60,0:11:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那覆满冰霜的战场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}frostbitten battlefield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天 我尚未看出你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}On that day, I did not yet see in you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德的拯救者 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard's savior. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were merely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小蓝冰棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little blue baby icicle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,却融化了我这老傻瓜的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}that melted this old fool's heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,精彩 精彩 演得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo! Bravo! Well done. Bravo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.47,0:11:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:12:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子 托尔回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my son, Thor, has returned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这出戏真有趣 叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an interesting play. What's it called?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德的洛基之惨剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tragedy of Loki of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,人民想纪念他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people wanted to commemorate him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, indeed they should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那座雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the statue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,比他在世时要好看多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot better looking than he was when he was alive, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不那么猥琐 油腻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little less weaselly, less greasy, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏尔特尔的头骨 厉害的武器啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skull of Surtur. That's a formidable weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.65,0:12:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙 把这个锁进地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor. Lock this away in a vault…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得它变成巨大的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it doesn't turn into a giant monster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁了整个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}and destroy the whole planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, dear. Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你要\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,回米德加德了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to Midgard for you, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近老做同一个梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been having this reoccurring dream lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,每晚上 我都看到阿斯加德化为灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night, I see Asgard fall into ruins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是个没意义的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just a silly dream…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明你的想象力太丰富了\N{\fnArial\fs30}signs of an overactive imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我决定出去勘察一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I decide to go out there and investigate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do I find, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国一片混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the Nine Realms completely in chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德的敌人集结起来 阴谋致我们于死地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enemies of Asgard assembling, plotting our demise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你\N{\fnArial\fs30}all while you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁 九大王国的保护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin, the protector of those Nine Realms…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,却穿着浴袍坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}are sitting here in your bathrobe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃着葡萄\N{\fnArial\fs30}eating grapes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们最好尊重邻居的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is best to respect our neighbors' freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 被屠杀的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course, the freedom to be massacred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 而且 我一直忙着呢 - 看剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, besides I've been rather busy myself. - Watching theater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会会议 安全理事会会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Board meetings, and security council meetings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真要逼我这么做吗 - 做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're really gonna make me do it? - Do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚 什么都无法阻止雷神之锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that nothing will stop Mjolnir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到我手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}as it returns to my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕是你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发疯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gone quite mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会被因此处死的 - 那我们就可以在另一边相见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll be executed for this. - Then I'll see you on the other side, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I yield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥丁森 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Odinson. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就一份工作 就这一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had one job. Just the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Odin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能别回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just couldn't stay away, could you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你一切都好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was fine without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德繁荣昌盛 都叫你毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard was prospering. You've ruined everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 问问他们 - 父亲在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ask them. - Where's Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你杀了他吗 - 你得到你想要的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you kill him? - You had what you wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得到你要的独立了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had the independence you asked for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哇 哇 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa! Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我就是把他留在这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I left him right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.77,0:14:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在人行道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here on the sidewalk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是在那栋正被拆除的建筑里\N{\fnArial\fs30}or right there where the building is being demolished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great planning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was I supposed to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不能看到未来 我不是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't see into the future. I'm not a witch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那你为什么穿得像个巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? Then why do you dress like one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 真不敢相信你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - I can't believe you're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你哀悼 为你哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mourned you, I cried for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm honored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以跟我们合个影吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Would you mind taking a picture with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快想想他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start figuring out where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 简甩了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to hear that Jane dumped you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她才没甩我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't dump me, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我甩了她 我们彼此互甩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dumped her. It was a mutual dumping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this? What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔·奥丁森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor Odinson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.14,0:15:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}God of Thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把伞放下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can put down the umbrella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上现在还有男巫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Earth has, uh, wizards now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们更喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The preferred term is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,被称为「魔法师」 别管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Master of the Mystic Arts." You can leave that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.55,0:16:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 男巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, wizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 我为什么要在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? Why should I care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是斯蒂芬·斯特兰奇博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Doctor Stephen Strange, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些问题要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have some questions for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝茶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't drink tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一份关注名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I keep a watch list{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是来自其他世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}of individuals and beings from other realms…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能对这个世界构成威胁的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that may be a threat to this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的领养弟弟 洛基 就是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your adopted brother, Loki, is one of those beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确该加上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a worthy inclusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么带他来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why bring him here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 如果我告诉你奥丁在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if I were to tell you where Odin was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有相关人士 都会马上回阿斯加德吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}all parties concerned would promptly return to Asgard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.45,0:17:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promptly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.37,0:17:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我来帮你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great! Then I'll help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你知道他在哪 为什么不联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you knew where he was, why didn't you call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你 他坚持不许人打搅他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell you, he was adamant that he not be disturbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲说他选择继续被流放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father said he had chosen to remain in exile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你没有电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't have a phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't have a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话 但你可以发个\N{\fnArial\fs30}phone. but you could have sent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,电子信件 叫电邮\N{\fnArial\fs30}an electronic letter. It's called an email.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 你有电脑吗 - 没有 干吗用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, do you have a computer? - No. What for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, my father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再被流放了 麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}is no longer in exile. So if you could{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他在哪 我就能带他回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me where he is, I can take him home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 他在挪威\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gladly. He's in Norway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.69,0:17:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是查看一下 这则咒语是否\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just seeing whether this incantation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要为阿斯加德人做些调整\N{\fnArial\fs30}requires any Asgardian modifications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we don't need that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:17:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能别那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stop doing that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.45,0:17:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以 我只要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I… I need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一根头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}just one strand of your hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me explain something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头发是碰不得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hair is not to be meddled with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全可以用走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have just walked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.72,0:18:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在等你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了你的伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget your umbrella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.15,0:18:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.70,0:18:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得要回我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose I'll need my brother back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been falling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,30分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for 30 minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.51,0:18:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就交给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can handle him from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much for your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「交给你」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handle me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:18:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么术士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're some kind of sorcerer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个二流货 别以为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think for one minute, you second-rate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allrgihts. Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.55,0:19:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这里 多美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this place. It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.31,0:19:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, it's us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我们来接你回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. We've come to take you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们母亲 她在召唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother, she calls me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基 解除你的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki, lift your magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了好久才摆脱你的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me quite a while to break free from your spell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗丽嘉会为你自豪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frigga would have been proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来陪我坐下 我没多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and sit with me. I don't have much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们辜负了你 但我们可以弥补的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that we failed you. But we can make this right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我辜负了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我阻止了诸神黄昏 我了结了苏尔特尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I've stopped Ragnarok. I put an end to Surtur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.59,0:20:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经开始了 她要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has already begun. She's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生命是唯一遏制着她的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life was all that held her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我大限将至\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my time has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法再抵住她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot keep her away any longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.70,0:20:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 你在说谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, who are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.21,0:20:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddess of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,海拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.05,0:20:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的长女\N{\fnArial\fs30}My firstborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.83,0:20:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的暴力欲望膨胀到我无法控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her violent appetites grew beyond my control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't stop her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.14,0:21:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就囚禁了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I imprisoned her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她关了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked her away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.53,0:21:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从阿斯加德汲取力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}She draws her strength from Asgard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.91,0:21:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等她到了那里 她的力量就将\N{\fnArial\fs30}and once she gets there, her powers will be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可限量\N{\fnArial\fs30}limitless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管她是什么 我们可以一同阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever she is, we can stop her together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以一同对抗她 - 不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can face her together. - No, we won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.69,0:21:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已走上了另一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on a different path now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事你们得独自面对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This you must face alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你们 我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, my sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.69,0:21:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.01,0:22:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.06,0:23:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜 我还挺想看到那一幕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a shame. I would've liked to have seen that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.20,0:23:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是海拉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Hela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是托尔 奥丁之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Thor, son of Odin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.03,0:23:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长得不像他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't look like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.68,0:23:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们可以商量一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we can come to an arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.37,0:23:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你口气像他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.53,0:23:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.42,0:23:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.28,0:23:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜见你的女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before your queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:23:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别指望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.11,0:24:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.28,0:24:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你根本想象不到我都能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, you have no idea what's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.98,0:24:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring us back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.42,0:24:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.40,0:24:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.67,0:25:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 你把托尔怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? What have you done with Thor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.62,0:25:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是海拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Hela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.75,0:25:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个扫地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a janitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.04,0:25:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去像个求生本能强烈的机灵鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like a smart boy with good survival instincts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.12,0:25:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要份工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you like a job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.44,0:28:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个战士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a fighter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you food?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.50,0:28:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是路过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just passing through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.88,0:28:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.32,0:28:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.11,0:29:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.94,0:29:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.92,0:29:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.41,0:29:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.43,0:29:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们想要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you want him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.86,0:29:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,得过我这关\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go through me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.95,0:29:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们已经得到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've already got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.16,0:29:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.54,0:29:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就先过你们这关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I go through you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.40,0:29:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来食物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.83,0:30:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.91,0:30:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拾荒者142号 我需要进门并觐见老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrapper 142. I need clearance and an audience with the boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.98,0:30:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带来了特别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got something special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.81,0:30:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你要带我去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Where are you taking me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.77,0:31:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.36,0:31:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.46,0:31:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是托尔 奥丁之子 我得回阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Thor, son of Odin. I need to get back to Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.35,0:31:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 王子殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many apologies, your majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.15,0:31:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现 你们并不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's come to my attention that you don't know who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.76,0:31:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是海拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Hela, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.42,0:31:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁的长女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin's firstborn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.54,0:31:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德大军的统帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}the commander of the Legions of Asgard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.87,0:31:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,王位的合法继承人 死亡女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rightful heir to the throne, and the Goddess of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.04,0:32:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.72,0:32:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位王子也是 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are the princes. You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾在宇宙中坐拥无上力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were once the seatof absolute power in the cosmos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.72,0:32:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的地位无可匹及\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our supremacy was unchallenged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.05,0:32:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但奥丁却止步于九大王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet Odin stopped at Nine Realms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.52,0:32:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的命运是统治所有其他王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our destiny is to rule over all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.64,0:32:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来恢复那份权势的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am here to restore that power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.03,0:32:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel before me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.86,0:32:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我 与我一起踏上伟大的征途\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rise into the ranks of my great conquest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.57,0:32:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever you are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.43,0:32:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你做了什么 马上投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you've done, surrender now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.64,0:32:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们绝不留情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we will show you no mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.91,0:32:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.54,0:32:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚说话你听没听啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you listen to a word I said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.40,0:32:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你最后的警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your last warning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.52,0:32:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们会乐意见到我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd be happy to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.23,0:32:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.94,0:33:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.83,0:34:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真怀念这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've missed this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.04,0:34:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 真是可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, it's a shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.17,0:34:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好战士白白枉死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good soldiers dying for nothing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.55,0:34:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他们看不到未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}all because they couldn't see the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.97,0:34:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.00,0:34:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.24,0:34:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,改主意了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change of heart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.26,0:34:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚回你爬出来的山洞去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to whatever cave you crept out of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.64,0:34:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个女魔头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You evil demoness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.44,0:34:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看我的王宫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go see my palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.26,0:35:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 你已被找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear not, for you are found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.65,0:35:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到家了 再也回不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are home, and there is no going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.41,0:35:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能离开此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one leaves this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.60,0:35:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.91,0:35:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.96,0:35:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sakaar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.12,0:35:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,被宇宙传送门环绕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrounded by cosmic gateways…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.39,0:35:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨卡位于已知和未知世界的边缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sakaar fives on the edge of the known and unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.30,0:35:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里收集了所有迷失\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the collection point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.84,0:35:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不被爱的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all lost and unloved things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.44,0:35:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如你\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.01,0:35:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在萨卡 你是重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here on Sakaar, you are significant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.89,0:35:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是有价值的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are valuable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.44,0:35:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是被爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are loved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.15,0:35:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.10,0:35:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人比宗师更爱你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one loves you more than the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.44,0:35:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是最初的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the original, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.48,0:35:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个迷失 第一个被找到的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the first lost and the first found…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.28,0:36:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨卡的创始人 冠军格斗之父\N{\fnArial\fs30}the creator of Sakaar… and father of the Contest of Champions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.67,0:36:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你曾经一文不名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where once you were nothing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.76,0:36:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在你有了身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}now you are something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.12,0:36:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是宗师的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the property of the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.16,0:36:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.18,0:36:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将在5秒后见到宗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will meet the Grandmaster in 5 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.00,0:36:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.96,0:36:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.98,0:36:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将见到宗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are now meeting the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.18,0:36:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真棒 是个「他」吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's wonderful. It is a he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.64,0:36:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.20,0:36:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.84,0:36:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢你过来 142\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love when you come to visit, 142.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.97,0:36:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总给我带最好的东西来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring me the best stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.06,0:36:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我们聊起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever we get to talking, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.37,0:36:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,托佩兹 拾荒者142号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Topaz, about Scrapper 142…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.78,0:36:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do I always say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.16,0:36:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「她是」 B开头的词\N{\fnArial\fs30}"She is the… " And it starts with a "B."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.56,0:36:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.38,0:36:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.04,0:36:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是就等着那么说她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you waiting just to call her that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.65,0:37:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是B开头的词\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't start with a "B."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.41,0:37:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒鬼婆娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Booze hag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.73,0:37:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不是「最好的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I… I'm so sorry. No, "best."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.61,0:37:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想说「最好的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking about "best."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.89,0:37:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我总说你是最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I always say you're the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.19,0:37:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为我带来了我的格斗冠军呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She brought me my beloved champion, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.14,0:37:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次她来你都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that every time she's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.06,0:37:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天带来的是什么 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you brought today? Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.93,0:37:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,参赛者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A contender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.94,0:37:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.11,0:37:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得凑近点 我要凑近看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to go closer. I want a closer look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.26,0:37:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以把我往前推推吗 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you take us closer? Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.18,0:37:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay this lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.00,0:37:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我等一下 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait a damn minute. I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.34,0:37:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是卖品\N{\fnArial\fs30}not for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.18,0:37:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 他挺有斗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, he's a fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.28,0:37:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一千万\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take 10 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.76,0:37:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她那是做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her she's dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.87,0:37:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 给她钱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for heaven's sakes, transfer the units.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.15,0:38:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll pay for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.80,0:38:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是别人付我钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got paid for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.29,0:38:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what I wanna know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.34,0:38:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.24,0:38:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the God of Thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.58,0:38:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听到雷声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hear any thunder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.87,0:38:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你手上的是电火花吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but out of your fingers, was that sparkles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.79,0:38:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到你表亲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've located your cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.21,0:38:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, oh, good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.80,0:38:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你会喜欢这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come on. I think you're gonna like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.13,0:38:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.22,0:38:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 表弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, cuz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.01,0:38:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差点没找到你 你藏起来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We almost couldn't find you. What, you been hiding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.35,0:38:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.18,0:38:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.73,0:38:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.14,0:38:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.00,0:38:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.45,0:38:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.09,0:38:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我赦免你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I pardon you. - Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.04,0:38:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.99,0:38:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被赦免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're officially pardoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.33,0:38:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,免了生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}From life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.58,0:38:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey. Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.10,0:39:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.54,0:39:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,流到我脚下了 看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stepping in it. I'm stepping in it. Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.88,0:39:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.04,0:39:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it smell like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.22,0:39:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,烤焦的吐司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burnt toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.59,0:39:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么这么没礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to my manners?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.75,0:39:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没好好自我介绍呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't properly introduced myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.34,0:39:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Uh, follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.65,0:39:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫宗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.77,0:39:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我主持一项 滑稽表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}I preside over a little harlequinade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.50,0:39:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做冠军格斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}called the Contest of Champions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.20,0:39:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自各处的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People come from far and wide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.73,0:39:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会不情愿地参与其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}to unwillingly participate in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.37,0:39:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.40,0:39:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以加入新角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might just be part of the new cast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.34,0:39:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say to that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.20,0:39:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是朋友 我也不在乎你的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not friends and I don't give a shit about your games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.49,0:39:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back to Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.11,0:39:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿屎加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ass-gard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.91,0:39:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.58,0:39:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下方有个时间空间的虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a Wormhole in space and time beneath me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.91,0:39:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是\N{\fnArial\fs30}At that moment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.74,0:39:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.25,0:39:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.71,0:39:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基 洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki! Loki!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.55,0:39:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here. Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.05,0:39:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 失陪一下 - 洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me one second. - Loki!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.26,0:39:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干什么 - 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You're alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.52,0:39:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我当然还活着 - 你怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, of course I'm alive. - What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.57,0:40:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话什么意思 我被困在这张\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, what am I doing? I'm stuck in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.04,0:40:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,破椅子上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this stupid chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.79,0:40:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么没坐椅子 - 没人让我坐椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's your chair? - I didn't get a chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.43,0:40:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我从这椅子上起来 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get me out of this one. - I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.69,0:40:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我起来 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get me out. What? - I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.40,0:40:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟那个宗师交了朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made friends with this man. He's called the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.17,0:40:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个疯子 - 我赢得了他的好感\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, he's crazy! - I've gained his favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.88,0:40:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,彩虹桥几周前把我丢到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bifrost brought me out here weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.60,0:40:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几周前 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Weeks ago? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.78,0:40:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.94,0:40:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在小声说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you whispering about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.20,0:40:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的时间规律很不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time works real different around these parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.12,0:40:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在别的世界上 我都该几百万岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On any other world, I'd be, like, millions of years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.33,0:40:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在萨卡上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here on Sakaar…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.38,0:40:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 你认识这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, you know this, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.62,0:40:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你称自己为雷王是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call yourself Lord of Thunder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.84,0:40:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神 告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}God of Thunder. Tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.14,0:40:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子从未见过这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never met this man in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.91,0:40:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是我弟弟 - 领养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's my brother. - Adopted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.71,0:40:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能不能打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he any kind of a fighter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.42,0:40:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我脖子上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take this thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.11,0:40:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西拿走 我就打给你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of my neck and I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.28,0:40:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 他在威胁我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen to that. He's threatening me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.23,0:40:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小火花 事情是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sparkles, here's the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.14,0:40:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想回到那个二死堡还是什么的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna get back to Ass-place, Assberg…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.78,0:40:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.84,0:40:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何参赛者 只要能打败我的冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any contender who defeats my champion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.87,0:40:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能赢得自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}their freedom they shall win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.14,0:40:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那就给我指个路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Then point me in the direction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.68,0:40:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我去揍的人在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}of whoever's ass I have to kick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.37,0:41:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我的参赛者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I call, contender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.04,0:41:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走 大王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Direction would be this way, Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.74,0:41:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Loki!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.50,0:41:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 放松点 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Take it easy, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.68,0:41:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.68,0:41:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你招手的一堆石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pile of rocks waving at you. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.68,0:41:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我其实是有生命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm actually a thing. I'm a being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.96,0:41:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我做个自我介绍 我叫寇格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Korg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.16,0:41:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算是这里的领导吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of like the leader in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.69,0:41:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也能看出来 我是石头做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm made of rocks, as you can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.47,0:41:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不要被我的外表吓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't let that intimidate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.33,0:41:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to be afraid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.40,0:41:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你是剪刀做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you're made of scissors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.39,0:41:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是跟你开个 石头剪刀布的小玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little rock-paper-scissor joke for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.99,0:41:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的好朋友 米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my very good friend over here, Miek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.70,0:41:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是只有剪刀手的昆虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an insect and has knives for hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.28,0:41:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是克努南人 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a Kronan, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.66,0:41:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 你怎么会落到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That I am. - How'd you end up in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.53,0:41:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试图发动革命来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, I tried to start a revolution, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.35,0:41:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没做好宣传工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}but didn't print enough pamphlets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.25,0:41:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以几乎没人参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hardly anyone turned up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.35,0:41:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我妈妈 和她那讨厌的男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}except for my mum and her boyfriend, who I hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.84,0:41:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为惩罚 我被迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}As punishment, I was forced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.88,0:41:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来到这里做个角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be in here and become a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.65,0:41:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是个宣传灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of a promotional disaster, that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.55,0:41:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我其实在策划另一场革命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm actually organizing another revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.45,0:42:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是不是感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you'd be interested in something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.64,0:42:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you reckon you'd be interested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.61,0:42:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.84,0:42:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这个地方其实是个圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yeah, no. This whole thing is a circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.78,0:42:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是真正的圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not a real circle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.22,0:42:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是个恐怖怪圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}more like a freaky circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.03,0:42:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.28,0:42:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这里就是不讲道理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nothing makes sense here, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.88,0:42:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没道理就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that does make sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.37,0:42:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that nothing makes sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.11,0:42:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有人跟宗师的冠军打过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone here fought the Grandmaster's champion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.60,0:42:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,道格打过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doug has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.70,0:42:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doug!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.91,0:42:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是命 道格已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our luck, Doug's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.39,0:42:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.80,0:42:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟宗师的冠军打过的人都死掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone who fights the Grandmaster's champion perishes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.88,0:42:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你是石头做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? You're made of rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.77,0:42:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,会死掉的石头 看啊 又掉一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perishable rock. There you go. Another one gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.72,0:42:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是小打小闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I just do the smaller fights, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.48,0:42:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,暖暖场之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}warm up the crowd and whatnot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.71,0:42:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你不是要去跟他打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You're not gonna face him, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.43,0:42:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.46,0:42:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟他打 打赢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna fight him, win, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.89,0:42:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后离开这鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get the hell out of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.05,0:42:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,道格以前就这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what Doug used to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.02,0:42:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见 新道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, new Doug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.65,0:43:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does no one remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.07,0:43:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人学过我们的历史吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has no one been taught our history?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.12,0:43:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at these lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.38,0:43:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,高脚杯 花园聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goblets and garden parties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.16,0:43:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace treaties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.47,0:43:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.88,0:43:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为成果骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}proud to have it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.78,0:43:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,却觉得手段可耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}ashamed of how he got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.32,0:43:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾势不可挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were unstoppable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.72,0:43:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在扩张阿斯加德帝国时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was his weapon in the conquest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.04,0:43:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是他的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}that built Asgard's empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.13,0:43:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们征服了一个又一个王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}One by one, the realms became ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.64,0:43:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 就因为我的野心比他更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, simply because my ambition outgrew his…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.02,0:44:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就将我放逐 囚禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}he banished me, caged me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.48,0:44:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,像只野兽一样把我锁了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}locked me away like an animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.95,0:44:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前 阿斯加德的战士是受尊敬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before that, Asgard's warriors were honored…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.97,0:44:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的遗体 像英雄那样葬在这宫殿下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}their bodies buried as heroes beneath this very palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.71,0:44:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥丁的宝藏 - 赝品\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Odin's treasures. - Fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.58,0:44:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里大部分的东西都是赝品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the stuff in here is fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.80,0:44:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.11,0:44:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我以为的要小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smaller than I thought it would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.27,0:44:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个还可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.26,0:44:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.00,0:44:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,永恒烈火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eternal Flame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.29,0:45:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看看真正的力量是什么样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to see what true power really looks like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.54,0:45:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的芬里斯 他们对你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fenris, my darling, what have they done to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.72,0:45:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,永恒烈火\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the Eternal Flame, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.40,0:45:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,将让你们重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are reborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.17,0:46:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.00,0:46:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念你们大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've missed you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.62,0:46:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.92,0:46:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿你升入英灵殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bid you take your place in the halls of Valhalla…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.44,0:46:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇者将在那里永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the brave shall live forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.39,0:46:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该高兴而不是哀伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor shall we mourn but rejoice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.94,0:46:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们死的光荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}for those that have died the glorious death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.80,0:46:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎心 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurts, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.48,0:46:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,被欺骗的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being lied to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.40,0:46:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being told you're one thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.17,0:46:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你发现那都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then learning it's all a fiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.56,0:46:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会以为我真的会来这里见你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think I'd really come and see you, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.56,0:46:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.30,0:46:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不想要我帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean you don't want my help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.10,0:46:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能失去我在宗师身边的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I couldn't jeopardize my position with the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.34,0:46:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为赢得他的信任很费心力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me time to win his trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.94,0:47:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个疯子 但也是有办法应付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a lunatic, but he can be amenable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.44,0:47:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm telling you is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.83,0:47:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以跟我一起服侍宗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could join me at the Grandmaster's side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.91,0:47:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 将来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps, in time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.08,0:47:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗师会出事 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}an accident befalls the Grandmaster, and then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.80,0:47:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真在考虑回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not seriously thinking of going back, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.60,0:47:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our sister{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.92,0:47:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,像砸玻璃一样轻松毁了你的锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}destroyed your hammer like a piece of glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.46,0:47:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比我们都强 她比你强\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's stronger than both of us. She's stronger than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.42,0:47:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一丝机会都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't stand a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.04,0:47:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我什么意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand what I'm saying to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.78,0:47:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.46,0:47:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我得单干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'll just have to go it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.08,0:47:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I've always done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.93,0:47:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能说点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you say something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.83,0:47:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.58,0:47:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you like me to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.19,0:47:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你装死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You faked your own death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.56,0:48:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷了王位 剥夺了奥丁的法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stole the throne, stripped Odin of his power…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.03,0:48:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他留在地球上等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}stranded him on Earth to die, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.85,0:48:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,放出了死亡女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}releasing the Goddess of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.56,0:48:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些够不够 还是你要我继续翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I said enough or would you like me to go back further than{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.81,0:48:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天之前的旧账\N{\fnArial\fs30}the past two days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.86,0:48:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没见过他口中这个宠儿冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I haven't seen this beloved champion he talks of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.74,0:48:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但听说他野蛮得吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've heard he is astonishingly savage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.29,0:48:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天的格斗 我下了很大的注压你输\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've placed a large wager against you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.46,0:48:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.23,0:48:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开 鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piss off, ghost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.26,0:48:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's freaking gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.30,0:48:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.37,0:48:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面还留着不知谁的毛发和血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still someone's hair and blood all over this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.86,0:48:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 格斗完能不能清理下武器啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, can you clean up the weapons once you finish your fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.90,0:48:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心的懒蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disgusting slobs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.63,0:48:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Thor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.46,0:48:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,用大木叉子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}wanna use a big wooden fork?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.28,0:48:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.00,0:48:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不太实用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not really useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.34,0:48:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你要打挤成一团的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you're fighting off three vampires{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.29,0:48:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}that were huddled together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.60,0:48:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我的锤子还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really wish I had my hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.95,0:49:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hammer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.63,0:49:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很特别 是用濒死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite unique. It was made from this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.46,0:49:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,星球内核的特别金属制成\N{\fnArial\fs30}special metal from the heart of a dying star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.23,0:49:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快速抡它 就能飞起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I spun it really, really fast, it gave me the ability to fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.07,0:49:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骑在锤子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rode a hammer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.34,0:49:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是骑在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't ride the hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.07,0:49:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它骑在你背上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hammer rode you on your back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.34,0:49:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我快速抡它 它就会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I used to spin it really fast, and it would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.13,0:49:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我带起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}pull me off the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.08,0:49:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 锤子给你撸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. A hammer pulled you off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.30,0:49:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我带离地面 它会带我离开地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ground. It would pull me off the ground, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.28,0:49:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我升入空中 我就能飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}up into the air, and I would fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.24,0:49:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I threw it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.13,0:49:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它总能回到我手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would always come back to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.40,0:49:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和这把锤子的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you had a pretty special{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.64,0:49:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像很特殊 很亲密\N{\fnArial\fs30}and intimate relationship with this hammer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.21,0:49:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去它堪比失去爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that losing it was almost comparable to losing a loved one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.15,0:49:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说挺温馨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a nice way of putting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.05,0:49:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了这些是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said they're mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.78,0:49:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 就是她把我抓来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See her, that's the one that put me in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.00,0:49:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 拾荒者142号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Scrapper 142.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.18,0:49:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要小心这些阿斯加德人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta watch out for those Asgardians, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.38,0:49:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,命硬得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are hard to perish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.35,0:49:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgardian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.45,0:49:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.81,0:49:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.30,0:49:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.56,0:49:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用那玩意电我 我有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not zap me with that thing. I just wanna talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.90,0:50:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德有危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard is in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.68,0:50:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你是女武神\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, you're a Valkyrie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.17,0:50:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候还想当女武神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to wanna be a Valkyrie when I was younger…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.54,0:50:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但之后我发现你们都是女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I found out that you were all women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.90,0:50:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是女的没什么不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing wrong with women, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.05,0:50:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.52,0:50:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时太爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes a little too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.15,0:50:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是猥琐的那种 是那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in a creepy way, just more of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.07,0:50:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊重的欣赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}a respectful appreciation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.34,0:50:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有一支女武士组成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's great that there is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.83,0:50:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,精英部队真的很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}an elite force of women warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.01,0:50:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.23,0:50:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说完没 - 雷王\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you done? - Lord of Thunder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.71,0:50:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该你了 - 求你 帮帮我 我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you're up. - Please, help me. I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.64,0:50:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.56,0:50:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你不是叛徒就是懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, then you must be a traitor or a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.61,0:50:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为女武神都发过誓要保卫王权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the Valkyrie is sworn to protect the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.97,0:50:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,听仔细了 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen closely, your majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.63,0:50:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是萨卡 不是阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sakaar, not Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.46,0:50:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拾荒者 不是女武神\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm a Scrapper, not a Valkyrie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.54,0:50:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他过来收拾一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him in for processing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.65,0:50:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能逃出这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one escapes this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.02,0:50:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你反正也是个死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're gonna die anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.22,0:51:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't you move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.93,0:51:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手不如以前稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands ain't as steady as they used to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.91,0:51:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,以奥丁的胡子起誓 你不准剪我的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}By Odin's beard, you shall not cut my hair…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.92,0:51:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就会尝到托尔之怒的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}lest you feel the wrath of the mighty Thor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.91,0:51:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你了 好心人 别剪我头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please, kind sir, do not cut my hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.79,0:51:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.05,0:51:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.54,0:51:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.24,0:51:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚比赛多么精彩 谁觉得开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a show! What a night! Who's having fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.04,0:51:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你们的主持人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I'm your host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.06,0:51:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,请掌声感谢所有赛前战的格斗者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big round of applause for all of our undercard competitors…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.77,0:51:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们今天死得真可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}who today died so gruesomely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.60,0:51:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good sports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.88,0:51:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚比赛多么精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a show! What a night!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.57,0:51:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是为格斗而来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you've come for, and so have I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.74,0:52:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 不再耽搁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, without further ado…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.02,0:52:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,压轴比赛开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's main event time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.08,0:52:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽是首次登场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making his first appearance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.79,0:52:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却很有潜力\N{\fnArial\fs30}though he looks quite promising…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.63,0:52:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点绝招\N{\fnArial\fs30}got a couple of tricks up his sleeve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.89,0:52:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再多说了 你们来自己判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll say no more, see what you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.84,0:52:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 有请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, I give you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.35,0:52:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord of Thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.74,0:52:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心他的手指 会放火花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out for his fingers. They make sparks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.05,0:52:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.90,0:52:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备欢迎这家伙吧 他来咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get ready to welcome this guy. Here he comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.76,0:53:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.53,0:53:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can we say about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.89,0:53:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很特别 独一无二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's unique. There's none like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.49,0:53:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得跟他有特别的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel a special connection with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.60,0:53:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从未有败绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's undefeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.36,0:53:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是连胜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the reigning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.37,0:53:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是卫冕方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the defending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.61,0:53:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.29,0:53:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.18,0:53:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,无敌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}… your incredible…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.70,0:53:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.13,0:53:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.33,0:53:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得离开这个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get off this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.02,0:53:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 你想去哪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.06,0:54:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.16,0:54:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.68,0:54:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我战友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a friend from work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.78,0:54:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.38,0:54:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody thought you were dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.38,0:54:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上次一别后发生了好多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But so much has happened since I last saw you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.43,0:54:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.15,0:54:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就昨天 还记忆犹新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, yesterday, so that's still pretty fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.34,0:54:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基还活着 相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki. Loki's alive. Can you believe it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.93,0:54:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.96,0:54:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基 看这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki! Look who it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.22,0:54:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳 真没想到我会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner, I never thought I would say this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.63,0:54:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我见到你可真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm happy to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.94,0:54:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人 绿巨人 绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk! Hulk! Hulk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.72,0:54:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.52,0:54:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Banner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.17,0:54:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是班纳 只有绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Banner. Only Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.85,0:54:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.10,0:54:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我啊 托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. It's Thor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.15,0:55:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳 我们是朋友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner, we're friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.52,0:55:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是疯了 我不想伤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy. I don't want to hurt you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.36,0:55:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 这才像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.33,0:55:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.14,0:56:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.21,0:56:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun's getting real low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.20,0:56:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 太阳要下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. The sun's going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.66,0:56:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再伤害你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't hurt you anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.67,0:56:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会伤害你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.46,0:56:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是这感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! That's how it feels!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.56,0:56:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是太喜欢这项运动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a huge fan of the sport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.32,0:56:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Screw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.28,0:57:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你还在的 班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in there, Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.56,0:57:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你逼出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.82,0:57:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了 真让我下不来台\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you? You're embarrassing me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.01,0:57:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还跟他们说我们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them we were friends!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.40,0:58:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷哥 雷哥 雷哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thunder! Thunder! Thunder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.10,0:58:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷哥 雷哥 雷哥 雷哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thunder! Thunder! Thunder! Thunder! Thunder! Thunder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.48,0:59:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一天 又一个道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another day, another Doug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.37,0:59:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that noise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.53,0:59:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,民众并没有乖乖听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The common folk aren't exactly falling in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.70,0:59:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有抵抗者想撞倒大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a resistance trying to knock down the front gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.07,0:59:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说你自己吧 斯科尔奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about yourself, Skurge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.09,1:00:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我爸是个石匠 我妈是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, me dad was a stonemason. Me mum was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.95,1:00:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 嗯 打住吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah, I'll just stop you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.82,1:00:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I meant was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.64,1:00:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的野心是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's your ambition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.67,1:00:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.35,1:00:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会证明自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}chance to prove myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.56,1:00:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,认可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recognition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.12,1:00:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我年轻时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was young…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.66,1:00:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,每位伟大国王都有个处刑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}every great king had an executioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.35,1:00:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是进行处刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just to execute people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.20,1:00:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也执行国王的愿景\N{\fnArial\fs30}but also to execute their vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.27,1:00:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但主要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mainly to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.98,1:00:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是做处刑的 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}execute people. Still, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.58,1:00:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这仍是无上光荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was a great honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.02,1:00:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是奥丁的处刑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was Odin's executioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.71,1:00:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.89,1:00:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就做我的处刑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall be my executioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.47,1:00:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始征程吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's begin our conquest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.01,1:01:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科尔奇 剑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skurge, where's the sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.92,1:01:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把剑是打开彩虹桥的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sword is the key to opening the Bifrost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.00,1:01:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提到的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people you mentioned, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.40,1:01:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些不肯乖乖就范的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ones who aren't falling into line…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.12,1:01:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们都抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}round them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.42,1:01:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.71,1:01:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.64,1:01:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些玩意到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}These bloody things are everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.85,1:01:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.13,1:02:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.35,1:03:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.02,1:03:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人洗热浴盆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Hulk in a hot tub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.98,1:03:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long have you been like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.90,1:03:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.45,1:03:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样 大块头 绿色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this. Big, and green, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.11,1:03:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆头呆脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.12,1:04:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人一直是绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk always Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.05,1:04:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么到这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.13,1:04:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.53,1:04:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说作弊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean cheating, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.89,1:04:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢的时候 对手也都有这玩意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were they wearing one of these when you won?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.54,1:04:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么来到这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you arrive here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.87,1:04:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,昆式战斗机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quinjet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.83,1:04:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那架昆式战斗机现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Now, where is the Quinjet now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.32,1:04:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没穿衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.44,1:04:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没穿衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.95,1:04:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下忘不掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in my brain now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.00,1:04:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,昆式战斗机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quinjet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.98,1:04:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.00,1:04:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带咱们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.72,1:04:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个糟糕的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a terrible, awful place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.22,1:04:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会喜欢阿斯加德的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna love Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.38,1:04:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很大 还金闪闪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's big. It's golden. Shiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.38,1:05:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.83,1:05:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我的人民需要我回阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. My people need me to get back to Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.13,1:05:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得阻止诸神黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must prevent Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.90,1:05:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ragnarok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.32,1:05:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家园的毁灭预言\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prophesied death of my home world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.19,1:05:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日 一切终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end of days, it's the end of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.61,1:05:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你帮我回阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you help me get back to Asgard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.00,1:05:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你回地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you get back to Earth. Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.12,1:05:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球恨绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth hate Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.41,1:05:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球爱绿巨人 他们爱死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth loves Hulk. They love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.33,1:05:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是复仇者联盟成员 我们的队友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of the Avengers. One of the team, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.15,1:05:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of our friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.46,1:05:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友就该如此 彼此支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what friends do. They support each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.42,1:05:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是班纳的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Banner's friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.84,1:05:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不是班纳的朋友 我更喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Banner's friend. I prefer you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.13,1:05:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner's friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.19,1:05:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不喜欢班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even like Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.49,1:05:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我喜欢数字 科学什么的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm into numbers and science and stuff."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.68,1:05:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔走 绿巨人留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor go. Hulk stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.55,1:05:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.35,1:05:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.22,1:05:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,破地方 难看死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid place. It's hideous, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.48,1:05:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是红 又是白 选个颜色吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The red, the white. Just pick a color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.40,1:05:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真荒唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.90,1:05:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,砸扁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smash you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.27,1:05:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才没砸扁什么 那场角斗我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't smash anything. I won that fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.80,1:05:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我砸扁了你 - 好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I smashed you. - Yeah, sure, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.13,1:05:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小手臂 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Baby arms. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.95,1:05:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.20,1:05:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴 你个幼稚鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moron! You big child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.94,1:05:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor gm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.91,1:06:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.10,1:06:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔再走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor go again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.12,1:06:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔在家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.52,1:06:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk trains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.27,1:06:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 祝你开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. Have fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.13,1:06:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊 大块头 - 生气姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, big guy. - Angry girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.12,1:06:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you been up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.37,1:06:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.16,1:06:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔 我知道你看得到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall, I know you can see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.66,1:06:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.74,1:06:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.35,1:07:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得到你 但你在很远的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you, but you're far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.72,1:07:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.01,1:07:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己来看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come see for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.08,1:07:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在祖先建造的要塞里庇护大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm providing refuge in a stronghold built by our ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.30,1:07:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果抵挡不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if the garrison falls, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.06,1:07:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能靠彩虹桥逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}our only escape is Bifrost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.75,1:07:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要疏散整个阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about evacuating Asgard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.87,1:07:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果留下我们都活不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't last long if we stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.45,1:07:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她汲取阿斯加德的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}She draws her power from Asgard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.02,1:07:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}and grows stronger every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.20,1:07:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.38,1:07:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,海拉很贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hela is ravenous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.95,1:07:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我放走了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let her leave, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.13,1:07:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会吞噬整个九大王国甚至宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'll consume Nine Realms and all the cosmos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.34,1:07:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.24,1:07:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想办法了 但我都不知道自己在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it. But I don't even know where the hell I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.63,1:07:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所在的星球周围都是传送门 穿过其中一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on a planet surrounded by doorways. Go through one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.33,1:07:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪个 - 大的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which one? - The big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.35,1:08:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.71,1:08:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.39,1:08:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.05,1:08:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不难过 你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sad, you idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.18,1:08:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在生气 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm pissed off! - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.07,1:08:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,愤怒 我失去了父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angry. I lost my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.88,1:08:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.20,1:08:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你都没认真听 - 唧唧歪歪 像个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not even listening. - Whining and crying. Cry like baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.79,1:08:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别踢东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't kick stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.53,1:08:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真不够朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being a really bad friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.78,1:08:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才不够朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bad friend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.12,1:08:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我们怎么喊你吗 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what we call you? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.54,1:08:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们喊你蠢复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call you the stupid Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.45,1:08:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是小复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're tiny Avenger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.24,1:08:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.40,1:08:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.32,1:08:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.55,1:08:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球是恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth does hate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.81,1:09:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.26,1:09:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.68,1:09:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了那些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.62,1:09:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是蠢复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the stupid Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.82,1:09:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人喊你蠢复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody calls you the stupid Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.89,1:09:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.41,1:09:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能随便冲人仍盾牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't go around throwing shields at people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.33,1:09:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have killed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.05,1:09:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.17,1:09:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是好生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just get so angry all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.85,1:09:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人总是很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk always, always angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.18,1:09:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我们是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. We're the same, you and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.10,1:09:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是俩鲁莽的傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just a couple of hot-headed fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.74,1:09:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 一样 绿巨人是火 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, same. Hulk like fire, - Mum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.56,1:09:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔是水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor like water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.60,1:09:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是火\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're kind of both like fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.59,1:09:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绿巨人是真火\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Hulk like real fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.52,1:09:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人是烈火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk like raging fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.11,1:09:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔是阴燃火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor like smoldering fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.96,1:10:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人 我需要你帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk, I need you to do something for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.20,1:10:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,生气姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angry girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.60,1:10:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? What are you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.35,1:10:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就蠢到看不出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so thick-headed that you can't tell…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.32,1:10:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家远远躲到了宇宙尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}when someone's hiding all the way across{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.69,1:10:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是不想被打扰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the universe and wants to be left alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.40,1:10:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得谈谈 - 不 你想跟我谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to talk. - No, you wanna talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.47,1:10:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要她留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need her to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.85,1:10:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.57,1:10:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,挡住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.44,1:10:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.07,1:10:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.98,1:10:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.04,1:10:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.20,1:10:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll listen to you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.62,1:10:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝光这个我就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}till this is empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.46,1:11:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德有危险 人民在牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard is in danger and people are dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.73,1:11:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回去 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get back there. I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.40,1:11:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝完了 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finished. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.20,1:11:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.71,1:11:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡女神海拉 入侵了阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hela, the Goddess of Death, has invaded Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.75,1:11:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果海拉回来了 那阿斯加德无望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Hela's back, then Asgard's already lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.37,1:11:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to stop her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.86,1:11:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个人吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alone? - Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.95,1:11:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在组建一支队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting together a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.65,1:11:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 你还有大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, you, and the big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.50,1:11:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不组队 绿巨人单干\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No team. Only Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.00,1:11:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me and you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.99,1:11:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看是只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's only you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.16,1:11:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 听我说 女武神都是传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Just listen. The Valkyrie are legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.54,1:11:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德的精英武士 发誓保护王权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elite warriors of Asgard sworn to defend the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.73,1:11:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting dragged into{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.89,1:11:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,被卷入奥丁的家庭纠纷当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}another one of Odin's family squabbles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.71,1:11:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这话什么意思 - 你姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that supposed to mean? - Your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.54,1:11:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的力量来自阿斯加德 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her power comes from Asgard, same as yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.63,1:11:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当奥丁无法控制她的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it grew beyond Odin's control{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.85,1:11:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就屠杀了王宫里的每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}she massacred everyone in the palace…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.53,1:11:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图夺取王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tried to seize the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.18,1:11:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她企图逃离驱逐时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she tried to escape her banishment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.90,1:11:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他派女武神去抵抗她\N{\fnArial\fs30}he sent the Valkyrie in to fight her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.56,1:11:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能生还只是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only survived because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.33,1:12:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经迎战过她一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I already faced her once{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.90,1:12:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我还相信王权的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}back when I believed in the throne…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.93,1:12:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it cost me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.43,1:12:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是阿斯加德的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what's wrong with Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.08,1:12:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,王权 秘密 金色的骗局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The throne, the secrets, the whole golden sham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.74,1:12:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.91,1:12:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太亲近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.86,1:12:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.45,1:12:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我拒绝了王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I turned down the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.06,1:12:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但关键不在于王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this isn't about the crown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.92,1:12:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about the people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.21,1:12:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要死了 他们也是你的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dying and they're your people, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.66,1:12:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.90,1:12:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.30,1:12:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.51,1:12:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 很好 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. Great. - Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.35,1:12:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.89,1:12:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.18,1:12:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't see that, did you'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.80,1:12:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 这下好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There… That's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.77,1:12:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.69,1:12:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下 为那个疯子奴役他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here and enslave people for that lunatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.06,1:12:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续喝酒 躲藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep drinking, keep hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.73,1:12:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.20,1:12:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会冲向我的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I choose to run toward my problems{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.17,1:12:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是逃避它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not away from them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.33,1:12:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's what…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.71,1:13:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 英雄都会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's what heroes do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.18,1:13:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend stay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.61,1:13:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.84,1:13:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.38,1:13:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.05,1:13:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 需要语音启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome. Voice activation required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.66,1:13:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.13,1:13:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,访问被拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access denied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.81,1:14:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔 奥丁之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, son of Odin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.48,1:14:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,访问被拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access denied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.65,1:14:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}God of Thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.85,1:14:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,访问被拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access denied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.13,1:14:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,最强大的复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strongest Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.65,1:14:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,访问被拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access denied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.15,1:14:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最强大的复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strongest Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.87,1:14:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,访问被拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access denied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.20,1:14:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌 斯塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn you, Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.08,1:14:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊爆点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point Break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.23,1:14:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 惊爆点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Point Break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.08,1:14:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.10,1:14:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留下 - 不 不 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- stay! - No, no, no! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.46,1:14:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.15,1:14:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人 别把飞机都撞烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop breaking everything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.71,1:14:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.68,1:14:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的 大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.94,1:14:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道奥创要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know where Ultron's headed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.43,1:14:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你飞得很高很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're going very high, very fast. So, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.41,1:14:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你得驾驶飞机返航\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to turn this bird around, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.15,1:14:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐匿模式追踪不到你 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't track you in stealth mode. So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.03,1:14:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮帮忙 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to help me out. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.31,1:14:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得 你得 你得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to… I need you to… I need you to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.79,1:15:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, Banner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.56,1:15:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, jeez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.84,1:15:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.45,1:15:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.30,1:15:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧 班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, Banner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.17,1:15:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快下山了 太阳快下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sun's going down. Sun's going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.64,1:15:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.23,1:15:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.34,1:15:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sun's going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.54,1:15:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托尔 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thor. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.44,1:15:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头发怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.01,1:15:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个猥琐的老头给我剪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some creepy old man cut it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.77,1:15:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挺帅的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It looks good. - Oh, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.38,1:15:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪 小娜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we? Oh, how's Nat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.02,1:15:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小娜肯定挺好的 - 她没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, Nat is good, I'm sure. - Is she okay'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.81,1:15:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 索科威亚呢 - 索科威亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what about Sokovia? - Sokovia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.90,1:15:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,索科威亚 那座城市 我们救下它了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city, Sokovia. Did we save it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.78,1:15:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 班纳 听我说 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Banner, listen. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.87,1:15:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,索科威亚 奥创 那是两年前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sokovia. Ultron. That was two years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.19,1:15:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.77,1:15:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.64,1:15:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了两年绿巨人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been Hulk for two years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.55,1:16:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.10,1:16:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.58,1:16:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳 你需要知道一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner, there's something you should know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.65,1:16:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要语音启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voice activation required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.31,1:16:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 班纳 - 欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Banner. - Welcome, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.76,1:16:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,最强大的复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}strongest Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.96,1:16:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃 什么 - 飞行日志\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, what? - Ship's log.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.20,1:16:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔 我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.99,1:16:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 关于那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.22,1:16:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨卡 请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sakaar, hear ye. Attention please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.41,1:16:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.59,1:16:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最爱的尊贵冠军失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beloved exalted champion has turned up missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.54,1:16:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,上街去为我的冠军欢庆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take to the streets. Celebrate my champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.31,1:16:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是谁 - 他算是这里的统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - He kind of runs the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.35,1:16:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在他家住了好一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually lived at his house for awhile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.08,1:16:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.24,1:16:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了好多事 我们俩最近打了一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a let's happened. You and I had a fight recently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.81,1:16:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我赢了吗 - 没有 我赢了 很轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I win? - No, I won. Easily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.93,1:16:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不对呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't sound right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.07,1:16:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.15,1:17:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来那个诱拐犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems that that criminally seductive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.21,1:17:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷王把他偷走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord of Thunder has stolen him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.99,1:17:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是诱拐犯雷神 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seductive God of Thunder. We need to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.74,1:17:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.12,1:17:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.48,1:17:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is really, really bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.21,1:17:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.28,1:17:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在抓狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm freaking out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.22,1:17:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.37,1:17:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别抓狂 你没事的 穿上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't freak out. You're okay. Put these on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.63,1:17:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是托尼的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are Tony's clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.74,1:17:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 穿吧 - 他也在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know, come on. - Is he here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.96,1:17:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他没在 听着 保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not here. But listen. Just stay calm, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.09,1:17:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快下山了 太阳要下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun's going down. The sun's getting really low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.46,1:17:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sun's going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.19,1:17:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm upset!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.19,1:17:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.95,1:17:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我喜欢生气的哪一点吗 怪罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I like about being upset? The blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.29,1:17:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我就想做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, that's the mindset that I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.75,1:17:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我怪谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know who I'm blaming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.98,1:17:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宗师 我可以 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grandmaster, I can… - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.46,1:17:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打断我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't interrupt me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.73,1:17:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.48,1:17:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干吗把融化棍递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you handing me the melt stick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.77,1:17:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打断了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was interrupting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.04,1:18:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又不是死罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a capital violation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.01,1:18:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说到哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.80,1:18:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝冠军不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My precious champion has come up missing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.29,1:18:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是因为那个雷王\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's all because of that Lord of Thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.42,1:18:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪他 你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all because of him. Your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.75,1:18:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们怎么回事 是领养还是另有隐情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the story is. Adopted, or complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.88,1:18:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信有很多渊源\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure there's a big history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.29,1:18:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你带来的参赛者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your contender…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.23,1:18:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.22,1:18:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能给我12小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you were to give me 12 hours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.17,1:18:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把他俩都活着带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could bring them both back to you. Alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.77,1:18:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我两小时就能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could do it in two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.19,1:18:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一小时就能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could do it in one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.45,1:18:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,打住吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stop there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.60,1:18:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我今早醒来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I woke up this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.38,1:18:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想的是公开处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}thinking about a public execution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.13,1:18:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 我可以安于\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for now, I'll settle for this sweet little…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.73,1:18:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,「谁能先抓到他」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Who's gonna get him first?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.46,1:18:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你们得抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're on the clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.84,1:18:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.94,1:18:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不听命于你 狗腿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't answer to you, lackey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.35,1:18:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.59,1:18:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要听命于宗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will answer to the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.14,1:18:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you help{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.24,1:18:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要帮我哥哥和那个绿傻瓜逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother escape with that green fool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.24,1:18:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不帮任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't help anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.39,1:19:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个女武神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a Valkyrie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.44,1:19:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为女武神都惨死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the Valkyrie had all died gruesome deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.69,1:19:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来要说什么想好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose your next words wisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.48,1:19:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 那记忆一定很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terribly sorry. Must be a very painful memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.65,1:20:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快下山了 要下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun's going down. It's getting really low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.90,1:20:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun's going down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.26,1:20:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun's going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.64,1:20:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要下山了 - 哦 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's getting real low. - Oh, shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.52,1:20:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太阳快下山了 - 你能不能别念叨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sun's getting low. - Would you stop saying that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.80,1:20:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是需要你保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need you to stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.99,1:20:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 我在外星球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm? I'm on an alien planet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.06,1:20:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正就是个星球 星球你也是去过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a planet. You've been on a planet before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.07,1:20:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 就一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.08,1:20:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你去过俩了 这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you've been on two. That's a good thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.98,1:20:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是新体验 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a new experience. - Oh, my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.44,1:20:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的神经元 已经在超过\N{\fnArial\fs30}My neurons, they're firing faster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.41,1:20:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大脑信息处理速度地运作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}than my brain can handle the information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.70,1:20:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的感觉完全不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole thing is totally different this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.02,1:20:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前 我一直觉得我和绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the past, I always felt like Hulk and I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.89,1:20:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,各有一只手把着方向盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}each had a hand on the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.58,1:20:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次 就好像他拿了车钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this time, it's like he had the keys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.23,1:20:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我被锁在后备箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the car and I was locked in the trunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.20,1:20:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在回来了 这才最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, you're back now. That's all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.12,1:20:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not what matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.13,1:20:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm trying to tell you, is that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.65,1:20:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我再变成绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I turn into the Hulk again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.29,1:20:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳可能就再也回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner may never come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.71,1:20:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们还困在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're stranded on a planet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.46,1:20:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一颗一切都让我紧张的星球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is designed to stress me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.36,1:20:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没被困 我会想到办法回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not stranded. I'm gonna figure out a way to get us home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.77,1:20:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不是你家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Not your home, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.40,1:20:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家 阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}though. Asgard. My home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.90,1:20:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.92,1:21:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我的人民身陷危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, my people are in great danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.31,1:21:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 我们得去击退一个非常厉害的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I, we have to fight this really powerful being…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.82,1:21:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰巧她还是我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}who also happens to be my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.43,1:21:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这太离谱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that is so wrong on so many…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.30,1:21:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想打你姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna fight your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.00,1:21:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是家庭问题 - 不 她是邪恶化身\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a family issue. - No, she's an evil being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.53,1:21:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管她怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.31,1:21:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再打谁了 我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not fighting any more beings. I'm sick of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.85,1:21:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我刚跟你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I just told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.26,1:21:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我再变成绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I turn into the Hulk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.65,1:21:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会变不回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am never gonna come back again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.35,1:21:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你都不在乎 - 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you don't care. - No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.09,1:21:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要组建一支队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting together the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.34,1:21:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人是火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hulk is the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.70,1:21:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是在利用我得到绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you're just using me to get to the Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.81,1:21:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 不 - 真过分\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? No! - It's gross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.28,1:21:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才不在乎我呢 你不是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't care about me. You're not my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.35,1:21:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是 我都不喜欢绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I don't even like the Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.13,1:21:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.40,1:21:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「砸扁 砸扁 砸扁」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Smash, smash, smash."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.05,1:21:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.58,1:21:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.01,1:21:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I'm being honest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.63,1:21:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在对抗邪恶化身这件事上\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it comes to fighting evil beings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.32,1:21:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是很强大很有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is very powerful and useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.90,1:21:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳也很强大很有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Banner's powerful and useful, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.95,1:21:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he though?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.02,1:21:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 绿巨人有几个博士学位 零\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok. How many PhDs does Hulk have? Zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.24,1:21:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳有多少个博士学位 七个\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many PhDs does Banner have? Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.24,1:21:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你不用打任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, you don't have to fight anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.33,1:21:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们在这里有危险 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're in danger here, so we have to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.08,1:22:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿那个做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.25,1:22:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要伪装 我是逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a disguise. I'm a fugitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.56,1:22:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也需要伪装 - 你就是伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need a disguise. - You are the disguise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.12,1:22:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我装成托尼·斯塔克 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be Tony Stark. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.82,1:22:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 托尼和吉普赛人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Tony and the gypsy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.93,1:22:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不是托尼 你是布鲁斯·班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you're not Tony. You're Bruce. Bruce Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.39,1:22:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么把我打扮成托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you dress me up like Tony?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.84,1:22:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你光着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you were naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.13,1:22:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这是个好理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll give you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.98,1:22:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么呢 别乱抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Stop doing that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.44,1:22:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼的裤子好紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony wears his pants super tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.14,1:22:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别抓了 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it! - I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.20,1:22:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么怪怪的 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you being so weird? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.48,1:22:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我在一个怪物体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the fact that I was trapped for two years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.08,1:22:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,困了两年所以才怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside of a monster made me a little weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.87,1:22:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Shh. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.61,1:22:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事的 冷静下来 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good. Calm down. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.04,1:22:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we're gonna go to Asgard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.73,1:22:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也不用去想绿巨人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're not gonna have to think about the Hulk ever again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.93,1:22:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right? - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.20,1:22:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人 绿巨人 绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk! Hulk! Hulk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.83,1:22:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. This is bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.44,1:22:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳 班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner! Banner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.90,1:22:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.82,1:23:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.27,1:23:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.70,1:23:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.00,1:23:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.25,1:23:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正打算那么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.58,1:23:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I did it first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.98,1:23:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.40,1:23:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.71,1:23:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干什么 你不是要走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here? I thought you were leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.58,1:23:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了点小岔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got sidetracked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.32,1:23:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.58,1:23:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my disguise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.86,1:23:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我能看到你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can see your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.30,1:23:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样你不就看不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not when I do this, you can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.87,1:23:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发型不错 我喜欢你的处理 换过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hair looks nice. I like what you did with it. Change it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.45,1:23:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是洗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washed it maybe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.20,1:23:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她眼睛上那个是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those things on her eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.61,1:23:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她杀过的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those the people that she's killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.93,1:23:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好美 强壮又勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's so beautiful and strong and courageous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.76,1:23:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.81,1:23:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我吗 - 我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a friend. - Who? Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.91,1:23:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是布鲁斯 - 我觉得我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Bruce. - I feel like I know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.80,1:24:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I know you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.32,1:24:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我多年来浑浑噩噩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've spent years in a haze, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.74,1:24:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想忘记过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to forget my past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.13,1:24:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨卡似乎是借酒消愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sakaar seemed like the best place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.44,1:24:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘记过去 混吃等死的绝佳之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}to drink and forget, and to die one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.80,1:24:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是觉得你喝得太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking that you drink too much, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.99,1:24:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会因此没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that probably was gonna kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.36,1:24:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没打算停止喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't plan to stop drinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.72,1:24:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't wanna forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.13,1:24:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再扭头不管了 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't turn away anymore, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.41,1:24:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I'm gonna die, well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.33,1:24:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不如是为了把我的剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}it may as well be driving my sword{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.10,1:24:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,插进那个屠夫婆娘的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the heart of that murderous hag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.66,1:24:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.48,1:24:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我是说 我想加入你的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm saying that I wanna be on the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.02,1:24:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有名字了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has it got a name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.72,1:24:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 叫报仇者联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's called the Revengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.45,1:24:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 报仇者 - 因为我要报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Revengers? - Because I'm getting revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.49,1:24:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.70,1:24:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 你想报仇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too. Do you want revenge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.14,1:24:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 呃 我还没决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh.. Uh… I'm undecided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.84,1:24:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 另外\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Also, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.30,1:24:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还带了示和礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a peace offering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.42,1:24:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊不惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.30,1:25:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,得确认一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just had to be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.38,1:25:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.85,1:25:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我见你时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, last time I saw you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.95,1:25:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想杀了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were trying to kill everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.50,1:25:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在都在忙什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you at these days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.80,1:25:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,每时每刻都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It varies from moment to moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.66,1:25:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是龙牙剑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a Dragonfang?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.48,1:25:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.57,1:25:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.93,1:25:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是著名的女武神之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the famed sword of the Valkyrie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.82,1:25:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨卡和阿斯加德之间离得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sakaar and Asgard are about as far apart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.14,1:25:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能更远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as any two known systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.45,1:25:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的办法 是走城外的一个虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best bet is a wormhole just outside of city limits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.11,1:25:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在山达尔补充燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refuel on Xandar, and we can be back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.67,1:25:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,18个月后就能回到阿斯加德了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Asgard in 18 months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.04,1:25:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我们要走大的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. We are going through the big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.46,1:25:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼屁眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil's Anus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.91,1:25:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.01,1:25:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 谁的屁眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. Whose anus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.17,1:25:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,声明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record, I didn't know it was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.32,1:25:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选的时候不知道它叫这么个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}called that when I picked it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.49,1:25:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像是在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks like a collapsing neutron star…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.40,1:25:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦罗森桥内坍缩的中子星\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside of an Einstein-Rosen Bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.57,1:25:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要另找艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need another ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.08,1:25:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会把我的船撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would tear mine to pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.59,1:25:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对 我们需要一艘能禁得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. We need one that can withstand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.26,1:25:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇点短程线拉力的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}the geodetic strain from the singularity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.06,1:25:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得有脱机动力转向系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}And has an offline power steering system…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.88,1:26:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有机载电脑也能运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could also function without the on-board computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.41,1:26:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得有杯托\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need one with cup holders, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.89,1:26:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们要死了 喝酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we're gonna die. So, drinks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.99,1:26:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你吗 我好像认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you? I feel like I know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.25,1:26:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得我认识你 好奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I know you, too. It's weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.87,1:26:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.89,1:26:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过不稳定的宇宙传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncharted metagalactic travel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.38,1:26:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行未知总星系旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}through a volatile cosmic gateway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.00,1:26:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才叫冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about an adventure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.18,1:26:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们需要一艘飞船 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need a ship. - Need a ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.44,1:26:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么一两艘飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are one or two ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.84,1:26:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝对是最顶尖的 - 你们不非得听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Absolute top of the line models… - I don't mean to impose…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.83,1:26:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但宗师有很多飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Grandmaster has a great many ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.78,1:26:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能还偷到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may even have stolen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.29,1:26:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他安全系统的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}the access codes to his security system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.41,1:26:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还突然难以抑制地想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And suddenly you're overcome with an urge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.16,1:26:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行正义之举吗 - 天啊 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to do the right thing. - Heavens, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.95,1:26:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗师对我的好感已消磨殆尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've run out of favor with the Grandmaster…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.76,1:26:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用飞船和密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in exchange for codes and access to a ship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.78,1:26:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,换安全穿过屁眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking for safe passage through the Anus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.39,1:26:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 你能让我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling us that you can get usaccess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.34,1:26:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入机库 而不触发警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the garage without setting off any alarms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.28,1:26:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 哥哥 我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, brother. I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.67,1:26:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我先 提醒你们一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, can I just… A quick FYI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.87,1:26:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几分钟前跟他说话的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just talking to him just a couple minutes ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.98,1:26:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很想杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was totally ready to kill any of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.38,1:26:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他确实想杀我来着 - 是啊 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He did try to kill me. - Yes, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.95,1:26:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多次呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}On many, many occasions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.36,1:26:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们小时候 有一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was one time when we were children…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.31,1:27:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变成了一条蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}he transformed himself into a snake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.02,1:27:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我喜欢蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he knows that I love snakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.40,1:27:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我捡起蛇 好好欣赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I went to pick up the snake to admire it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.19,1:27:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他变了回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he transformed back into himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.79,1:27:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大喊 「嘿 是我」 然后捅了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was like, "Yeah, it's me!" And he stabbed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.24,1:27:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时才八岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were eight at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.44,1:27:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要偷飞船的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're boosting a ship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.69,1:27:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把王宫的守卫引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna need to draw some guards away from the palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.72,1:27:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放出野兽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not set the beast loose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.31,1:27:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh… Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.48,1:27:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys have a beast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.65,1:27:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没什么野兽 他在胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's no beast. He's just being stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.16,1:27:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要挑起革命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to start a revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.77,1:27:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 革命 - 我过会儿再解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Revolution? - I'll explain later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.69,1:27:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是谁来着 - 过会儿再解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's this guy again? - I'll explain later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.09,1:27:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拉出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that some sort of protoplasm, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.41,1:27:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是原生质吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the stuff that's coming out of you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.01,1:27:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是卵\N{\fnArial\fs30}or are they eggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.32,1:27:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像卵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.04,1:27:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找寇格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Korg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.49,1:27:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's asking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.93,1:27:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.06,1:27:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别人吗 还是只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone else asking, or is it just you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.73,1:27:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷王向你问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord of Thunder sends his best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.15,1:27:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,革命开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The revolution has begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.56,1:27:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,革命 怎么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revolution? How did this happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.77,1:28:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.29,1:28:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但角斗场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the arena's mainframe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.91,1:28:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,服从圆盘主机被关掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Obedience Disks have been deactivated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.58,1:28:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奴隶都武装起来了 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and the slaves have armed themselves. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.14,1:28:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢那个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I don't like that word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.11,1:28:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个 主机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which? Mainframe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.29,1:28:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我怎么会不喜欢「主机」\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why would I not like "mainframe"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.74,1:28:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,S开头的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the "S" word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.99,1:28:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 在职囚犯们都武装起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, the prisoners with jobs have armed themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.04,1:28:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.63,1:28:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们应该谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so, listen. We should talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.94,1:28:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I disagree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.34,1:28:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家从来就不擅长开诚布公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open communication was never our family's forte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.43,1:28:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.84,1:28:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上次谈过后发现的真相很是了不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been quite the revelation since we last spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.96,1:28:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.44,1:28:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.62,1:28:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁让我们聚在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin brought us together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.10,1:28:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的死让我们分裂 还挺诗意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost poetic that his death should split us apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.00,1:29:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在与陌生人无异\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might as well be strangers now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.33,1:29:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位王子 各自漂泊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two sons of the crown, set adrift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.42,1:29:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是不想谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you didn't wanna talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.84,1:29:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.98,1:29:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能留在萨卡更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm probably better off staying here on Sakaar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.85,1:29:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what I was thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.39,1:29:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚是在同意我说的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just agree with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.86,1:29:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方太适合你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this place is perfect for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.52,1:29:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,野蛮 混乱 无法无天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's savage, chaotic, lawless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.49,1:29:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,弟弟 你会在这儿如鱼得水的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, you're gonna do great here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.27,1:29:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就真这么瞧不起我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you truly think so little of me'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.19,1:29:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基 我曾非常看重你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki, I thought the world of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.04,1:29:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们能永远并肩战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were gonna fight side by side forever. But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.03,1:29:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最终 你是你 我是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the end of the day, you're you and I'm me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.29,1:29:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也说不好 或许你还有一丝良心 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, maybe there's still good in you. But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.91,1:29:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's be honest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.94,1:29:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早已分道扬镳\N{\fnArial\fs30}our paths diverged a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.08,1:29:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.45,1:29:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们还是再也不要见面了比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably for the best that we never see each other again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.66,1:29:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你一直想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you always wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.36,1:30:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来演「喊救命」吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let's do "Get Help."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.22,1:30:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 「喊救命」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - "Get Help."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.67,1:30:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我非常讨厌 - 来嘛 你最喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. I hate it. - Come on, you love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.65,1:30:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招多棒啊 每次都好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great. It works every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.68,1:30:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太丢人了 - 你有更好的计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's humiliating. - Do you have a better plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.25,1:30:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 那就这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - We're doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.88,1:30:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要演「喊救命」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not doing "Get Help."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.02,1:30:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get help! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.51,1:30:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟快死了 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother, he's dying. Get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.37,1:30:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.43,1:30:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完美 - 经典\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good. - Classic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.62,1:30:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Sun hate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.23,1:30:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太丢人了 - 我又不丢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's humiliating. - Not for me, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.83,1:30:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 她让我们上哪艘船来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, which one's the ship she told us to get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.37,1:30:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,司令号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Commodore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.88,1:30:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.58,1:30:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我觉得应该也没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I feel it won't make much of a difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.33,1:30:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.23,1:30:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我背叛过你很多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I've betrayed you many times… before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.94,1:30:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次真不是针对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this time it's truly nothing personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.94,1:30:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到你的赏金会让我过得很阔绰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reward for your capture will set me up nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.04,1:30:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果然从不是个重感情的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never one for sentiment, were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.67,1:30:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,无情会过得更轻松些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier to let it burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.61,1:30:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.90,1:31:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来好痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that looks painful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.28,1:31:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的弟弟 你越来越好猜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear brother, you're becoming predictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.40,1:31:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任你 你背叛我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you, you betray me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.40,1:31:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一遍又一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Round and round in circles we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.67,1:31:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基 人生 是要成长的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Loki, life is about, it's about growth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.94,1:31:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要改变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.03,1:31:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你好像只想保持原样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you seem to just wanna stay the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.88,1:31:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess what I'm trying to say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.54,1:31:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都只是恶作剧之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that you'll always be the God of Mischief…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.96,1:31:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你本可不止如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you could be more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.72,1:31:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把这个留给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just put this over here for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.12,1:31:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们都还有地方要去 所以祝你好运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, all got places to be, so good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.19,1:31:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你能搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I can figure this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.23,1:31:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是又一艘宇宙飞船罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just another spaceship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.75,1:31:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠诚的萨卡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyal Sakaarians…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.55,1:31:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷王偷了我的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord of Thunder has stolen my ship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.52,1:31:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我最爱的冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my favorite champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.44,1:32:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨卡人 升空 把他打下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sakaarians, take to the skies. Bring him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.95,1:32:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让他离开这个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let him leave this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.74,1:32:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打得不错 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good shot! - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.04,1:32:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.16,1:32:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.76,1:32:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你比看起来要坚强一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that you're tougher than you look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.79,1:32:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.02,1:32:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该反击什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't we be shooting back or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.34,1:32:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.61,1:32:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这船上的武器在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the guns on this ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.39,1:32:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.89,1:32:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是艘消遣船 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a leisure vessel. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.72,1:32:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗师用它来享乐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandmaster uses it for his good times, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.76,1:32:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,群交派对之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}orgies and stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.06,1:32:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刚刚是说宗师用这船办群交派对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she just say the Grandmaster uses it for orgies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.71,1:33:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.90,1:33:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.62,1:33:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.79,1:33:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.24,1:33:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.53,1:33:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.16,1:33:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该去帮帮她 你过来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should probably go and help. Here, take the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.12,1:33:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不会开这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't know how to fly one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.69,1:33:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个科学家 用你的博士学位去搞明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a scientist. Use one of your PhDs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.63,1:33:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些学位都不是外星飞船驾驶啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them are for flying alien spaceships!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.50,1:34:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.66,1:34:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面肯定有枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a gun on this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.75,1:34:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那看起来好像是枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks like a gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.09,1:34:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my birthday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.54,1:34:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my birthday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.43,1:34:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my birthday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.64,1:34:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.16,1:35:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我们马上就要进入恶魔屁眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we're coming up on the Devil's Anus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.37,1:35:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.53,1:35:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逃离的途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our ticket out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.01,1:35:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.37,1:35:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.90,1:35:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我们要跳上那艘超大飞船离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to jump on that ginormous spaceship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.17,1:35:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.28,1:35:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do seem like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.98,1:35:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实急需一位领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're in desperate need of leadership.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.81,1:35:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.15,1:35:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.78,1:35:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.15,1:36:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgardians…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.26,1:36:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有不知好歹的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}some misguided soul…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.41,1:36:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷走了彩虹桥之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}has stolen the Bifrost sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.85,1:36:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们它在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us where it is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.26,1:36:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则后果自负\N{\fnArial\fs30}or there will be consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.80,1:36:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,严重的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.01,1:36:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.19,1:36:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.15,1:36:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.76,1:36:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.64,1:37:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.88,1:37:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,处刑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Executioner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.73,1:37:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.17,1:37:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.40,1:37:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道剑在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where the sword is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.53,1:38:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到我还能再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought I'd be back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.29,1:38:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为会更美一些呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it'd be a lot nicer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.19,1:38:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒不是说它不美\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not that it's not nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.02,1:38:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, it's on fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.59,1:38:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 山上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, up here in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.01,1:38:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有热信号 那里聚集了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heat signatures. People clustered together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.42,1:38:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要去找他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's coming for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.58,1:38:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 把我丢在王宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, drop me off at the palace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.78,1:38:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去引开她 - 你想害死自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I'll draw her away. - And get yourself killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.03,1:38:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,困在那里的人才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people trapped down there are all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.78,1:38:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去应付海拉时\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I'm dealing with Hela, I need you two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.37,1:38:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得疏散阿斯加德的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help get everyone off Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.08,1:38:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell are we supposed to do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.04,1:38:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在地面上有人接应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a man on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.75,1:38:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.97,1:38:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.06,1:39:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下飞船有火力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the ship has a gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.76,1:39:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.85,1:39:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在武器库发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this in the armory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.25,1:39:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.86,1:39:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.19,1:39:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.08,1:39:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.88,1:40:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停步\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.39,1:40:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去彩虹桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the Bifrost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.72,1:41:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.15,1:41:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.02,1:41:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你对这里的改造\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love what you've done with the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.03,1:41:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,重装修了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redecorating, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.66,1:41:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们父亲解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems our father's solution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.87,1:41:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有问题的思路都是掩盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}to every problem was to cover it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.85,1:41:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,或驱逐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to cast it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.26,1:41:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你说你有资格\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told you you were worthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.60,1:41:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也对我说过这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said the same thing to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.86,1:41:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.92,1:41:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never knew him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.30,1:41:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见过他最辉煌的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at his best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.74,1:41:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁和我曾让整个文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin and I drowned entire civilizations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.41,1:41:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,淹死在血泪之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}in blood and tears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.26,1:41:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这些金子是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think all this gold came from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.43,1:41:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.60,1:41:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天他突然决定做个仁慈的君王\N{\fnArial\fs30}one day he decided to become a benevolent king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.31,1:41:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造和平 保护生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}To foster peace, to protect life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.02,1:42:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,生下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.22,1:42:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解你的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand why you're angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.22,1:42:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毕竟是我姐姐 严格讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are my sister, and technically{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.15,1:42:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有权继承王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}have a claim to the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.74,1:42:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我也愿意别人来统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}And believe me, I would love for someone else to rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.82,1:42:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不能是你 你真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it can't be you. You're just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.21,1:42:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.29,1:42:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.30,1:42:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐在我的位置上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in my seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.11,1:42:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲曾对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Father once told me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.42,1:42:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位明君从不挑起战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a wise king never seeks out war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.11,1:42:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但必须时刻做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}But must always be ready for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.72,1:43:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.39,1:43:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.85,1:43:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我以为你有更大本事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, I expected more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.39,1:43:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.87,1:43:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sword!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.09,1:44:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的不同之处在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the difference between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.86,1:44:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是奥丁的长女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Odin's firstborn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.45,1:44:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,合法继承人 阿斯加德的拯救者\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rightful heir, the savior of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.30,1:44:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.05,1:44:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此简单 瞎子都看得清\N{\fnArial\fs30}So simple, even a blind man could see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.74,1:44:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下你让我想起了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you remind me of Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.20,1:44:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只臭狗打不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stupid dog won't die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.89,1:45:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 交给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be all right now. I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.70,1:45:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.09,1:45:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.96,1:45:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.01,1:46:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 谁都别想跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? No one's going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.43,1:46:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拿到那把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get that sword…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.68,1:46:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕我为此要杀光他们每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if I have to kill every single one of them to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.47,1:46:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.82,1:46:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是寇格 这是米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Korg. This is Miek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.32,1:46:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要跳上那艘飞船离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna jump on that spaceshipand get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.30,1:46:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.31,1:46:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的拯救者到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your savior is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.62,1:46:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.42,1:47:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快上船吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, on that ship now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.55,1:47:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 我看到你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home. I saw you coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.83,1:47:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.78,1:47:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然是英勇之举 但你们毫无胜算\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a valiant effort, but you never stood a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.85,1:47:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.53,1:47:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是女王 或怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a queen or a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.65,1:47:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是死亡女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Goddess of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.26,1:47:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么的神来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you the god of, again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.03,1:47:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是你有两只眼睛时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when you had two eyes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.76,1:47:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也只能看清一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd see only half the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.01,1:48:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她太强大了 没有锤子 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's too strong. Without my hammer, I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.08,1:48:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是托尔 锤子之神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Thor, the God of Hammers? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.78,1:48:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,锤子是用来帮你控制力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hammer was to help you control your power, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.32,1:48:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中力量的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to focus it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.35,1:48:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你力量的源泉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was never your source of strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.71,1:48:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了 她已经夺下了阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late. She's already taken Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.12,1:48:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德不是一个地方 从来不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard is not a place. Never was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.09,1:48:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就可以是阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.66,1:48:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德是我们人民的所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard is where our people stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.57,1:48:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.52,1:48:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人民需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}right now, those people need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.08,1:48:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不像你那么强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not as strong as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.95,1:48:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.38,1:48:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.73,1:49:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.16,1:49:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么的神来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you the god of again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.08,1:51:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来迟了 - 你缺了只眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're late. - You're missing an eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.40,1:51:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没打完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.10,1:51:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们该解散报仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should disband the Revengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.43,1:51:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,用闪电打她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit her with a lightning blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.79,1:51:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚用史上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hit her with the biggest lightning blast{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.54,1:51:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大的闪电打她了 毫无作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the history of lightning. It did nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.98,1:51:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得抵住她 直到大家都上了船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need to hold her off until everyone's on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.14,1:51:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不是个完\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't end there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.95,1:51:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,海拉在阿斯加德待得越久 她就越强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer Hela's on Asgard, the more powerful she grows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.55,1:51:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会找到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll hunt us down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.49,1:51:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在此时此地阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to stop her here and now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.28,1:51:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.18,1:51:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再演「喊救命」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing "Get Help."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.75,1:52:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德不是一个地方 是人民所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard's not a place, it's a people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.29,1:52:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.32,1:52:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不是要阻止诸神黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}this was never about stopping Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.61,1:52:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要引发诸神黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was about causing Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.73,1:52:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏尔特尔的王冠 在地堡里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surtur's crown, the vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.84,1:52:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.00,1:52:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真大胆 哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bold move, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.66,1:52:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不敢想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.46,1:52:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.66,1:52:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.15,1:53:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.09,1:53:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.87,1:54:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.50,1:54:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,海拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hela!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.46,1:55:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,永恒烈火\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the Eternal Flame, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.06,1:55:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,将让你重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are reborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.91,1:55:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,海拉 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hela, enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.15,1:55:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要阿斯加德 它是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want Asgard, it's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.08,1:55:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你在玩什么把戏 不会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever game you're playing, it won't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.73,1:55:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想打败我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't defeat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.13,1:55:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.26,1:55:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.48,1:55:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.73,1:55:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我脚下震颤吧 阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tremble before me, Asgard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.27,1:55:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your reckoning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.81,1:56:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,人民安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people are safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.00,1:56:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.56,1:56:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们实现了预言\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fulfilling the prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.55,1:56:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨这则预言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.93,1:56:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 但我们没别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I, but we have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.05,1:56:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏尔特尔毁掉阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surtur destroys Asgard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.70,1:56:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能毁掉海拉 我们的人民才能生还\N{\fnArial\fs30}he destroys Hela, so that our people may live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.34,1:56:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得让他做完\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we need to let him finish the job, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.19,1:56:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.25,1:56:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.39,1:56:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人 停下 你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk, stop, you moron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.42,1:56:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.69,1:56:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这一次 别砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for once in your life, don't smash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.68,1:56:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big monster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.89,1:56:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.91,1:56:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.13,1:57:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿斯加德的末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Asgard's doom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.05,1:57:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁得还不算太严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}The damage is not too bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.43,1:57:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要地基还撑得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as the foundations are still strong…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.26,1:57:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能重建\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can rebuild this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.43,1:57:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will become a haven…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.41,1:57:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,全宇宙人民和外星人的避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all peoples and aliens of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.18,1:58:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下地基是没了 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now those foundations are gone. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.88,1:58:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.05,1:58:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我们免遭灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved us from extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.63,1:58:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德不是一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard is not a place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.91,1:58:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是人民的所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.72,1:58:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It suits you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.97,1:59:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你也没那么坏 弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're not so bad after all, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.04,1:59:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.36,1:59:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.28,1:59:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真在这里 我或许还会抱抱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were here, I might even give you a hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.91,1:59:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.57,1:59:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.96,1:59:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.21,1:59:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.57,2:00:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.87,2:00:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.83,2:00:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么提议吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any Suggestions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.69,2:00:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克 你是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miek, where are you from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.96,2:00:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Miek's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.90,2:00:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我刚刚在桥上不小心踩到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I accidentally stomped on him on the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.05,2:00:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just felt so guilty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.49,2:00:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱了他一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been carrying him around all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.43,2:00:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miek, you're alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.02,2:00:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.16,2:00:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚问什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your question again, bro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.09,2:00:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,去地球吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.10,2:02:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得回地球是个好主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think it's a good idea to go back to Earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.00,2:02:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.06,2:03:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球人民喜欢我 我很受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people of Earth love me. I'm very popular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.87,2:03:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我换个说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me rephrase that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.87,2:03:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得带我回地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think it's a good idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.77,2:03:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个好主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring me back to Earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.76,2:03:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 或许不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not, to be honest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.82,2:03:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't worry, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.57,2:03:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得一切都会没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like everything's gonna work out fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.69,2:09:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.23,2:09:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 我为你们所有人骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gotta say, I'm proud of you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.58,2:09:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场革命非常成功 大家好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This revolution has been a huge success. Yay, us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.07,2:10:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼓励鼓励自己 干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pat on the back. Pat on the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.70,2:10:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛 不吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.35,2:10:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 因为我是其中重要的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too. 'Cause I've been a big part of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.55,2:10:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人去推翻 哪里来的革命呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't have a revolution without somebody to overthrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.33,2:10:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.58,2:10:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们平手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, it's a tie.{\r}
